    title: "Authentic Singaporean Chilli Crab with Golden Fried Mantou Buns",
    name: "Authentic Singaporean Chilli Crab with Golden Fried Mantou Buns",
    description: "Singapore's world-famous national seafood dish: sweet, succulent mud crab stir-fried in a luscious, semi-thick, sweet, savory, and spicy tomato-chili sauce with delicate ribbons of beaten egg.",
