    description: "A celebrated Sri Lankan Malay dessert of dark, steamed spiced coconut custard made with authentic kithul palm jaggery, thick coconut cream, farm eggs, ground cardamom, nutmeg, and cloves, garnished with toasted whole cashews.",
    category: "Sri Lankan",
    origin: "Sri Lanka (Sri Lankan Malay & Moor Heritage)",
