    title: "Sri Lankan Parippu Curry (Dhal Curry)",
    name: "Sri Lankan Parippu Curry (Dhal Curry)",
    description: "An essential Sri Lankan comfort curry made with tender Mysore red lentils simmered in coconut milk, turmeric, fenugreek, and aromatics, crowned with a sizzling tempered oil (theldala) of black mustard seeds, shallots, dried red chilies, and crispy curry leaves.",
    category: "Sri Lankan",
    origin: "Sri Lanka",
