    title: "Authentic Taiwanese Brown Sugar Boba Pearl Milk Tea",
    name: "Authentic Taiwanese Brown Sugar Boba Pearl Milk Tea",
    description: "Taiwan's world-famous artisanal beverage featuring chewy warm tapioca boba pearls simmered in dark caramelized Muscovado brown sugar syrup, swirled into creamy whole milk with black Assam tea.",
